Open a gateway to the Fearscape, stepping through it to a nearby location. As you step out, a burst of fire will leave with you, dealing [140, 188, 226, 258, 286 (TL1-5; SP 100)] demonfire damage to everyone within [1, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] spaces and leaving flames which will deal an additional [140, 188, 226, 258, 286 (TL1-5; SP 100)] demonfire damage over 4 turns.

Additionally, shifting through reality enhances your awareness, allowing you to see all enemies within [8, 8, 9, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] spaces for the next 3 turns.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower and the range will increase with the talent level.
